    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a recent In-Situ simulation held at the operating theatre, CIME introduced Victoria, a high-fidelity birthing simulator, for the first time. The session unfolded unexpectedly when a routine day turned into a critical scenario, testing the team's response to a gynaecological emergency.",
